# Secrets for this Worker. Copy to .dev.vars for `npm run dev`; in production
# set them with `npx wrangler secret put <NAME>` (the Deploy to Cloudflare
# button prompts for them).

# Password for your budgets. If set before the first start, the server sets
# itself up with it, so nobody else can claim the first-visit "set password"
# screen. Ignored once a password exists. Use a long, unique value.
SETUP_PASSWORD=
